                                                                                                     "heading":  "Product Specifications",
                                                                                                     "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModern C-Shaped Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Sleek and minimalist, the C-shaped profile allows the table to slide under sofas, beds, or chairs for convenient use as a laptop desk, coffee table, or side accent\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWalnut-Finish Top:\u003c/strong\u003e The tabletop is crafted from high-quality blister density board (MDF) with a rich walnut finish, giving it a smooth, stylish look that complements any interior.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStable Metal Base:\u003c/strong\u003e Supported by a thick black steel frame and reinforced oval base for maximum stability, durability, and a touch of contemporary flair.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpace-Saving Side Table For Couches\u003c/strong\u003e : If you\u0027re looking for space-saving furniture for a small room, this compact sofa table is perfect for you. It doesn\u0027t require much space but is incredibly useful as a versatile side table, coffee table, or snack holder. Its Space-saving and C shape design easily slides under sofas or beds. Perfect for small apartments, dorms, and compact rooms.\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                                                                 }
                                                                                },
