                                                                               "settings":  {
                                                                                                "heading":  "Product features",
                                                                                                "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmooth \u0026 Easy to Clean:\u003c/strong\u003e The surface is water stain-resistant, friction-resistant, and wipes clean easily—ideal for hassle-free daily use and entertaining.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact \u0026 Versatile:\u003c/strong\u003e At 58 cm high with a 38 x 28 cm tabletop, it fits perfectly in small spaces for use as a bedside or sofa table, plant stand, or reading nook companion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMultipurpose Functionality:\u003c/strong\u003e Perfect for serving snacks, drinks, reading material, and even as a workspace for laptops or tablets—great for living rooms, bedrooms, balconies, or offices.\u003c/p\u003e",
